  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GHUBRA POWER-DESALINATION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE INSTALLATION OF A NEW UNIT FOR DESALINATION OF SEA WATER FOR THE PROVISION OF 30,000 M3/DAY OF FRESH WATER TOGETHER WITH A PORT GENERATION PLANT OF 30 MW CAPACITY. THIS CONSTITUTES THE FIRST PHASE OF A BIG PROJECT AIMING AT MEETING THE GROWING DEMAND OF THE CAPITAL CITY OF MUSCAT FOR WATER AND ELECTRICITY</narrative>
  </description>
